      "key": [
        "Golden Troupe",
        "Faded Castle",
        "Ancient Autoharmonic Music Box"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Boethius: The Golden Troupe",
      "content": "After Remuria fell, Boethius gathered its remnants into the Golden Troupe in the Faded Castle. They studied spirit and fate, built musical devices like those of the golden age and aimed to rescue Phobos so music could unite the world. The Marechaussee Hunters were founded to fight them and their enslaved golems. The Troupe also, per the wiki, practised child sacrifice.\n\nLater the master Ruggiero and Cassiodor sealed the Faded Castle under rebuilt Petrichor and spread false stories to hide its secrets.",
