      "key": [
        "Harmost of Remuria",
        "four Harmosts",
        "Remurian Harmost"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Boethius: Harmost of Remuria",
      "content": "The Harmosts were four officials whom Remus promoted and shared his power with. They helped oversee Remuria and could alter Phobos's melody, which only they and the Sebastos could do. Boethius and Cassiodor were two of them; the wiki lists the other two as Aurelius and Euergetia.",
