    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Scylla",
        "Fell Dragon Prince",
        "Bane Dragon"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Boethius: Scylla",
      "content": "The dragon prince led barbarians and vishaps against Remuria. Boethius had the Initium Iani shut and sealed him beneath the Domus Aurea with the golden Ichor, where he stayed for thousands of years. Scylla told Cassiodor that the attack was not betrayal but part of Remus's plan, and that Boethius was the real traitor.",
