    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Phobos",
        "Grand Symphony",
        "the Symphony"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Boethius: Phobos",
      "content": "The Symphony that governed Remuria gained a persona through the Remurians' wishes and became Phobos. It says it devoured Boethius and made him its instrument. In Fortune Plango Vulnera it seeks to raise Boethius as a second Remus; Cassiodor traps it in a Legatus Golem body so the Traveler can destroy it.",
