      "key": [
        "Cassiodor and Boethius",
        "brothers of Remuria",
        "brother Harmosts"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Boethius: Cassiodor and Boethius",
      "content": "They met in the war against Cassiodor's tribe and became close friends, calling each other brother. Boethius accused Cassiodor of a soft heart, Cassiodor accused Boethius of ignoring the voices of those below him. Their quarrel in the artifact text 'Golden Bird's Shedding' foreshadows the rebellion.",
